{"id":12123,"date":"2025-02-21T13:32:00","date_gmt":"2025-02-21T13:32:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/?page_id=12123"},"modified":"2025-04-22T18:07:08","modified_gmt":"2025-04-22T18:07:08","slug":"researchvisitprog","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/researchvisitprog\/","title":{"rendered":"Visiting Researcher Program"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover is-light page-cover\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:#161228\"><\/span><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-12104\" alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/02\/IMG_9797-scaled.jpg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/02\/IMG_9797-scaled.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/02\/IMG_9797-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/02\/IMG_9797-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/02\/IMG_9797-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/02\/IMG_9797-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/02\/IMG_9797-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/02\/IMG_9797-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\">\n<h1 class=\"has-white-color has-text-color\">Visiting Researcher Program<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/docs.google.com\/forms\/d\/e\/1FAIpQLSfg_cfGl2FCem6X3N-kOVzh3mlWq3wKptoyCl3CgBTphf9T1A\/viewform?usp=header\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Click to Apply<\/strong><\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group pad-5\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\">\n<h2>Overview<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h4>Join a vibrant and collaborative research environment at AIMS Ghana!<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>We welcome researchers from around the world, from diverse fields and varying levels of expertise, to contribute to transformative research in the Mathematical Sciences. Our Visiting Researcher Program offers a unique opportunity to engage with a dynamic community of scholars and students committed to innovation, learning, and impact.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-2 wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"732\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/02\/412726815_1087951282176457_6506258794251068562_n-edited-1024x732.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12103\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/02\/412726815_1087951282176457_6506258794251068562_n-edited-1024x732.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/02\/412726815_1087951282176457_6506258794251068562_n-edited-300x214.jpg 300w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/02\/412726815_1087951282176457_6506258794251068562_n-edited-768x549.jpg 768w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/02\/412726815_1087951282176457_6506258794251068562_n-edited-1536x1098.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/02\/412726815_1087951282176457_6506258794251068562_n-edited-18x12.jpg 18w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/02\/412726815_1087951282176457_6506258794251068562_n-edited.jpg 1626w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/02\/IMG_9627-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12170\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/02\/IMG_9627-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/02\/IMG_9627-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/02\/IMG_9627-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/02\/IMG_9627-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/02\/IMG_9627-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/02\/IMG_9627-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h2>Research Areas<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>We invite researchers who do research across a wide range of topics, including (but not limited to):<br>\u25cf Algebra<br>\u25cf Mathematical Physics<br>\u25cf Quantum Computing and Quantum Algorithms<br>\u25cf Quantum Gravity<br>\u25cf Stochastic Analysis and Applications<br>\u25cf AI in Mathematical Science<br>\u25cf Data Science<br>\u25cf Mathematical Biology<br>\u25cf Climate Change Modeling<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4>Flexible Research Stays<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Whether you are taking a short research break or planning a year-long sabbatical, AIMS Ghana offers flexible hosting options. Visiting researchers may spend a few days, several weeks, or up to one year with us, depending on your availability and goals.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4>Opportunities for Visiting Researchers<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<h5><\/h5>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Start new research project<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Collaborate with other researchers from different parts of the world<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Teach advanced courses or lead interactive seminars<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Supervise and mentor graduate student projects<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Present your work at our workshops, seminars, and conferences<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Engage in interdisciplinary discussions and knowledge-sharing sessions<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>We especially encourage interdisciplinary research that applies mathematical tools to real-world challenges.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h4>Eligibility <\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Applicants should hold a PhD in<strong> <\/strong>the<strong> <\/strong>Mathematical<strong> <\/strong>Sciences or a closely related field and should have an active research agenda.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover app-cover\" style=\"min-height:169px\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-100 has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:#161228\"><\/span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\">\n<div style=\"height:35\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:35\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"white-text\">Support and Resources<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Visiting researchers benefit from our 24\/7 learning environment, which provides:<br>\u25cf Accommodation and meals<br>\u25cf Office space and high-speed internet<br>\u25cf Research facilities and institutional libraries<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>For further information or inquiries, please reach out via: <strong>researchvisit@aims.edu.gh<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:45\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:45\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover is-light app-cover\" style=\"min-height:145px\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-white-background-color has-background-dim-100 has-background-dim\"><\/span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\">\n<div style=\"height:35\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"white-text\"><mark style=\"background-color:#fff\" class=\"has-inline-color has-gray-dark-color\">We value your contribution<\/mark> <\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>We invite you to bring your expertise, ideas, and enthusiasm to AIMS Ghana. Be part of a pan-African network committed to   shaping the future of Science and using Mathematics and Scientific Innovation for the common good of humanity.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:45\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/docs.google.com\/forms\/d\/e\/1FAIpQLSfg_cfGl2FCem6X3N-kOVzh3mlWq3wKptoyCl3CgBTphf9T1A\/viewform?usp=header\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Click to Apply<\/strong><\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Overview Join a vibrant and collaborative research environment at AIMS Ghana! We welcome researchers from around the world, from diverse fields and varying levels of expertise, to contribute to transformative research in the Mathematical Sciences. Our Visiting Researcher Program offers a unique opportunity to engage with a dynamic community of scholars and students committed to<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":10,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":1,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"advgb_blocks_editor_width":"","advgb_blocks_columns_visual_guide":""},"acf":[],"coauthors":[],"author_meta":{"author_link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/author\/charlene\/","display_name":"charlene"},"relative_dates":{"created":"Posted 9 months ago","modified":"Updated 7 months ago"},"absolute_dates":{"created":"Posted on February 21, 2025","modified":"Updated on April 22, 2025"},"absolute_dates_time":{"created":"Posted on February 21, 2025 1:32 pm","modified":"Updated on April 22, 2025 6:07 pm"},"featured_img_caption":"","featured_img":false,"series_order":"","_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/12123"}],